  "term": "BWAS",
  "definition": "BWAS stands for the Bergen Work Addiction Scale, a 7-item questionnaire used to assess work addiction. It measures core features of work addiction based on an addiction-components model, including salience, mood modification, tolerance, withdrawal, conflict, relapse, and problems.",
